# wave-templates.vrs: the 2026-10-16 fixes and Epic A43. (1) zombie-apocalypse with its Admin goal starts from
# `.nyar event start` (G-Portal 2026-10-15 refused it "badarg location admin_location"); it is stopped at once. (2) each
# faction wave template starts at the admin and queues wave 1, then is stopped. (3) realm-gauntlet runs every wave: each is
# killed with `.devkill`, the next is queued only after "wave <n> cleared", the last brings its V Blood, and the event ends
# "all waves defeated". Every event added here is deleted at the end. Generated from Resources/templates.json.
# Needs: NyarDevTools (.devgo .devkill .devunits), DevChatEcho; the pond mark; no purge cooldown; no other event running;
# Chaos invulnerable (true only).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .nyar template use zombie-apocalypse as apo-admin
expect-reply apo-admin
chat .nyar event enable apo-admin
expect-reply apo-admin
mark
chat .nyar event start apo-admin
expect-log event apo-admin started by timeout=20
expect-no-log admin_location timeout=1
wait 5
chat .nyar event stop apo-admin
expect-log event apo-admin stopped timeout=20
wait 10
chat .nyar template use militia-muster
expect-reply militia-muster
chat .nyar event enable militia-muster
expect-reply militia-muster
mark
chat .nyar event start militia-muster
expect-log event militia-muster started by timeout=20
expect-log event militia-muster wave 1/5: 6 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full wave-militia-muster
chat .nyar event stop militia-muster
expect-log event militia-muster stopped timeout=20
wait 20
chat .nyar template use silverlight-crusade
expect-reply silverlight-crusade
chat .nyar event enable silverlight-crusade
expect-reply silverlight-crusade
mark
chat .nyar event start silverlight-crusade
expect-log event silverlight-crusade started by timeout=20
expect-log event silverlight-crusade wave 1/5: 7 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full wave-silverlight-crusade
chat .nyar event stop silverlight-crusade
expect-log event silverlight-crusade stopped timeout=20
wait 20
chat .nyar template use legion-incursion
expect-reply legion-incursion
chat .nyar event enable legion-incursion
expect-reply legion-incursion
mark
chat .nyar event start legion-incursion
expect-log event legion-incursion started by timeout=20
expect-log event legion-incursion wave 1/4: 6 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full wave-legion-incursion
chat .nyar event stop legion-incursion
expect-log event legion-incursion stopped timeout=20
wait 20
chat .nyar template use gloomrot-assault
expect-reply gloomrot-assault
chat .nyar event enable gloomrot-assault
expect-reply gloomrot-assault
mark
chat .nyar event start gloomrot-assault
expect-log event gloomrot-assault started by timeout=20
expect-log event gloomrot-assault wave 1/4: 6 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full wave-gloomrot-assault
chat .nyar event stop gloomrot-assault
expect-log event gloomrot-assault stopped timeout=20
wait 20
chat .nyar template use cursed-night
expect-reply cursed-night
chat .nyar event enable cursed-night
expect-reply cursed-night
mark
chat .nyar event start cursed-night
expect-log event cursed-night started by timeout=20
expect-log event cursed-night wave 1/4: 7 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full wave-cursed-night
chat .nyar event stop cursed-night
expect-log event cursed-night stopped timeout=20
wait 20
chat .nyar template use realm-gauntlet
expect-reply realm-gauntlet
chat .nyar event enable realm-gauntlet
expect-reply realm-gauntlet
mark
chat .nyar event start realm-gauntlet
expect-log event realm-gauntlet started by timeout=20
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 1/5: 8 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full gauntlet-1
chat .devkill -301730941 60
chat .devkill -1301144178 60
chat .devkill -1030822544 60
wait 3
chat .devkill -301730941 60
chat .devkill -1301144178 60
chat .devkill -1030822544 60
wait 3
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 1 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 2/5: 8 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full gauntlet-2
chat .devkill -837329073 60
chat .devkill -195077008 60
chat .devkill -1146194149 60
wait 3
chat .devkill -837329073 60
chat .devkill -195077008 60
chat .devkill -1146194149 60
wait 3
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 2 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 3/5: 9 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full gauntlet-3
chat .devkill -63435588 60
chat .devkill 956965183 60
chat .devkill -249647316 60
wait 3
chat .devkill -63435588 60
chat .devkill 956965183 60
chat .devkill -249647316 60
wait 3
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 3 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 4/5: 9 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full gauntlet-4
chat .devkill 1732477970 60
chat .devkill 674807351 60
chat .devkill 820492683 60
wait 3
chat .devkill 1732477970 60
chat .devkill 674807351 60
chat .devkill 820492683 60
