expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 5/5: 9 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
shot full gauntlet-5
chat .devunits -26105228 60
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=1 prefab=-26105228
chat .devkill 2128996433 60
chat .devkill 426583055 60
chat .devkill 1728773109 60
chat .devkill -26105228 60
wait 3
chat .devkill 2128996433 60
chat .devkill 426583055 60
chat .devkill 1728773109 60
chat .devkill -26105228 60
wait 3
expect-log event realm-gauntlet wave 5 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event realm-gauntlet ended: all waves defeated \(5 of 5 waves\) timeout=20
wait 5
chat .nyar event delete apo-admin confirm
expect-reply apo-admin
wait 1
chat .nyar event delete militia-muster confirm
expect-reply militia-muster
wait 1
chat .nyar event delete silverlight-crusade confirm
expect-reply silverlight-crusade
wait 1
chat .nyar event delete legion-incursion confirm
expect-reply legion-incursion
wait 1
